kintaiyi (太乙神数 / Tai Yi divination engine)
  Source: https://github.com/kentang2017/kintaiyi
  Author: kentang2017
  License: MIT

  fatebridge/core/metaphysics/taiyi.py contains a pure-Python port of the
  太乙統宗 人道命法 (life-chart) algorithm and its lookup tables, transcribed
  from kintaiyi's kintaiyi.py and config.py. FateBridge does not depend on
  kintaiyi at runtime; only the algorithm and constant tables were vendored,
  and calendar / 节气 inputs are produced by FateBridge's own swisseph-backed
  engine. The MIT license text below is retained as required.

